Feature: Email and Password Login
    As a user
    I want to be able to log in with my email and password
    So that I can access my account securely

    Scenario: User can log in with email and password
        Given I am on the login page
        When I enter a valid email and password
        And I click the login button
        Then I should be redirected to the main page
        And I should see a welcome message
    
    Scenario: User can't log in with invalid email and valid password
        Given I am on the login page
        When I enter a invalid email and valid password
        And I click the login button
        Then I should see an error message

    Scenario: User can't log in with valid email and invalid password
        Given I am on the login page
        When I enter a valid email and invalid password
        And I click the login button
        Then I should see an error message

    Scenario: Users with abc.com domain need to see  a error message
        Given I am on the login page
        When I enter an email with abc.com domain and valid password
        And I click the login button
        Then I should see an error message


    Scenario: Users with google.com domain need to see  a error message
        Given I am on the login page
        When I enter an email with google.com domain and valid password
        And I click the login button
        Then I should see an error message, "Please use your Google account to log in"